thcare services exactly when they need them and reach you in record time.</span></p> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-40a3355\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-id=\"40a3355\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a112dd8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"a112dd8\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<img alt=\"Optimized local SEO\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-9553\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"667\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Optimized-local-SEO.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Optimized-local-SEO.jpg 1000w, /wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Optimized-local-SEO-300x200.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Optimized-local-SEO-768x512.jpg 768w\" width=\"1000\"/> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-3ae2340 elementor-section-full_width grey_bg elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-id=\"3ae2340\">\n<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-8638027\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-id=\"8638027\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-00199b7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"00199b7\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<img alt=\"HIPAA compliance\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-9560\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"563\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/HIPAA-compliance.jpg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/HIPAA-compliance.jpg 1000w, /wp-content/uploads/2020/11/HIPAA-compliance-300x169.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2020/11/HIPAA-compliance-768x432.jpg 768w\" width=\"1000\"/> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-608a0dc\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-id=\"608a0dc\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-22713a8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"22713a8\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<h2><b>HIPAA compliance</b></h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our websites are compliant with the Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act (HIPAA). This law governing website ensures that all protected information relating to health is transport encrypted and utilizes storage encryption. Moreover, we ensure that the data is accessible only by authorized personnel, frequently updated and backed up, protected from tampering and alterations, is disposed of permanently when not required, and is located on a secure server.</span></p> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-705f100 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-id=\"705f100\">\n<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-5fc59ee\" data-e-type=\"column\"